      "category": "syntax",
      "title": "输出调用没有闭合",
      "prompt": "补齐语法错误，并计算x的两倍加三，输出整数及换行。保留输入绑定，真实使用乘法和加法；合法等价顺序或临时变量均可。",
      "tests": [
        {
          "caseKey": "negative",
          "input": {
            "x": -4
          },
          "expectedStdout": "-5\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        },
        {
          "caseKey": "zero",
          "input": {
            "x": 0
          },
          "expectedStdout": "3\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        },
        {
          "caseKey": "positive",
          "input": {
            "x": 5
          },
          "expectedStdout": "13\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        },
        {
          "caseKey": "upper",
          "input": {
            "x": 999
          },
          "expectedStdout": "2001\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        }
      ],
      "brokenBody": "printf(\"%d\\n\", x * 2 + 3;\nreturn 0;",
      "solutionBody": "printf(\"%d\\n\", x * 2 + 3);\nreturn 0;",
      "alternativeBody": "int doubled = x * 2;\nint answer = 3 + doubled;\nprintf(\"%d\\n\", answer);\nreturn 0;",
      "hints": [
        "分清算式和包住整个调用的括号。",
