      "category": "logic",
      "title": "零走错了分支",
      "prompt": "修复边界判断：x非负时输出1，否则输出0，末尾换行。必须保留真实if/else及输入依赖，两条路径都要在测试中执行。",
      "tests": [
        {
          "caseKey": "negative",
          "input": {
            "x": -3
          },
          "expectedStdout": "0\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        },
        {
          "caseKey": "zero",
          "input": {
            "x": 0
          },
          "expectedStdout": "1\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        },
        {
          "caseKey": "positive",
          "input": {
            "x": 4
          },
          "expectedStdout": "1\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        },
        {
          "caseKey": "upper",
          "input": {
            "x": 999
          },
          "expectedStdout": "1\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        }
      ],
      "brokenBody": "if (x > 0) { printf(\"1\\n\"); } else { printf(\"0\\n\"); }\nreturn 0;",
      "solutionBody": "if (x >= 0) { printf(\"1\\n\"); } else { printf(\"0\\n\"); }\nreturn 0;",
      "alternativeBody": "if (x < 0) { printf(\"0\\n\"); } else { printf(\"1\\n\"); }\nreturn 0;",
      "hints": [
        "程序可以正常结束，但输出不一定符合题意。",
        "比较负数、零、正数分别经过哪条路径。",
        "零属于非负数；也可以反过来先判断是否为负。"
      ],
      "explanation": "严格大于零遗漏了零。修复可以采用x>=0，也可以用x<0调换分支；真实判题同时核对输出和if/else覆盖，不要求固定写法。"
    },
    {
      "exerciseRef": {
        "id": "exercise.c.bug-sum-initial",
        "version": "1.0.0"
      },
      "baseExerciseRef": {
        "id": "exercise.c.array-sum",
        "version": "1.1.0"
      },
      "category": "logic",
      "title": "总和为什么总多一？",
      "prompt": "修复数组累加程序，真实遍历逻辑范围[0,n)，输出总和及换行。空数组的和为0；保留输入和n，不读取空数组占位元素。",
      "tests": [
        {
          "caseKey": "empty",
          "input": {
            "values": []
          },
          "expectedStdout": "0\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        },
        {
          "caseKey": "single",
          "input": {
            "values": [
              4
            ]
          },
          "expectedStdout": "4\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        },
        {
          "caseKey": "mixed",
          "input": {
            "values": [
              -2,
              5
            ]
          },
          "expectedStdout": "3\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        },
        {
          "caseKey": "seven",
          "input": {
            "values": [
              7,
              -3,
              0,
              5,
              -3,
              2,
              9
            ]
          },
          "expectedStdout": "17\n",
          "expectedExitCode": 0
        }
      ],
      "brokenBody": "int sum = 1;\nfor (int i = 0; i < n; i = i + 1) { sum = sum + values[i]; }\nprintf(\"%d\\n\", sum);\nreturn 0;",
      "solutionBody": "int sum = 0;\nfor (int i = 0; i < n; i = i + 1) { sum = sum + values[i]; }\nprintf(\"%d\\n\", sum);\nreturn 0;",
      "alternativeBody": "int total = 0;\nfor (int i = n - 1; i >= 0; i = i - 1) { total = total + values[i]; }\nprintf(\"%d\\n\", total);\nreturn 0;",
      "hints": [
        "比较期望输出和实际输出的差，再观察变量初始值。",
        "空数组不进入循环，此时输出应是多少？",
        "加法累计从0开始；前向或后向遍历都要覆盖全部逻辑元素。"
      ],
      "explanation": "初值1在任何输入上都会多加一。初值改为0后，空数组无需特殊读取；合法反向遍历也能通过实际求和与遍历目标。"
    }
